config GN25L95_PHY
	tristate "Semtech GN25L9x/GN28L9x xPON optical frontend"
	depends on I2C
	select FW_LOADER
	select REGMAP_I2C
	select OPTICAL_FRONTEND
	help
	  Support the Semtech GN25L95/GN25L98 2.5 Gbit/s and GN28L96 10 Gbit/s
	  burst-mode laser drivers and limiting post amplifiers. GN28L96 supports
	  factory EEPROM calibration and board-specific host calibration in MCU
	  mode. Experimental GN28L98 support is limited to diagnostics on an
	  already-configured SFF-8472 interface; host calibration and transmitter
	  control are not implemented for that model.
	  The driver is an independent
	  provider of the generic optical frontend subsystem and is not tied to
	  Airoha MAC or PHY drivers.
